# Background: (v0.2) runs after the screen is opened and before the conditions of every block
# (the unconditional one included); And when: composes conditions. definitions/background.ts logs
# the order in which the definitions run and checks it.
Screen: Composed Login
  Background: The order log is started
  Background: A valid email is typed

  Element: Login Form
    Show: Email address

  Element: Login Button
    When: The order is checked
    Enable

    When: The email is cleared
    And when: The order is checked
    Disable
